  "metaDescription": "Every Mercantile config option: server settings (pickup, names, trade cycling, reputation, follow mode, pathfinding, sentry pylon) and client settings, with types, defaults, and ranges.",
  "ogTitle": "Config — Mercantile",
  "ogDescription": "Every Mercantile config option with types, defaults, and ranges.",
  "title": "Configuration",
  "lede": "Every Mercantile setting, organized by section. Tune via the Mod Menu + Cloth Config GUI or by hand-editing the JSON file.",
