    {
      "id": "file-location",
      "title": "File Location &amp; Reload",
      "plainTitle": true,
      "blocks": [
        { "type": "code", "label": "The config file is generated on first launch at:", "code": ".minecraft/config/mercantile.json", "bottomGap": true },
        { "type": "code", "label": "Server operators can apply changes without a restart with:", "code": "/mercantile reload", "bottomGap": true },
        { "type": "prose", "html": [
          "Missing keys are filled with defaults and saved. Unknown keys are ignored. All numeric values are clamped on load — out-of-range hand edits are silently corrected."
        ] }
      ]
    },
    {
